    "Versatile (medium)": "Can also fire as a medium howitzer. (declare what shell is loaded if setting on Ambush) (v3 page 50 AoI)",
    "Slow (only when towing)": "(p119) A vehicle designated as slow has a basic move rate of 6\" when Advancing and 12\" at a Run - only applies when towing.",
