    "Ancillary": "May not be given the Command Vehicle special rule for the purposes of creating an Armoured Platoon.",
    "Just a cart": "Tachanka move as wheeled vehicles. In addition, to represent the vulnerability of the horses, it has been given an unusually low Damage Value, and every time it suffers one or more pin markers as a result of an enemy attack, it automatically suffers one additional pin marker.",
    "Armoured Gun Boat": "The first time a damage roll resolved against the Bronekater equals or exceeds the Bronekater’s Damage Value, the result on the Damage Results on Armoured Vehicles table is always considered to be a 1, regardless of the actual result rolled.",
    "Waterborne": "May only move in areas of deep or shallow water, being treated as a tracked vehicle for speed and turning ability.",
    "Recce": "Can reverse at full Advance speed (instead of half speed). In addition, if shot at by an enemy unit (and has not yet taken an action that turn), it may react by immediately making an Escape move at full Run speed away from the enemy or into cover.",
    "Vulnerable": "Because of its light armour, all shorts to the side and rear of the vehicle get an additional +1 penetration modifier (i.e. in total, +2 for side hits and +3 for rear hits).",
    "(75mm) HE (2\")": "Instead of HE (1\") the medium anti-tank gun has HE (2\") (75mm gun tanks).",
